    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="4a4789c1-83ed-5090-8b43-b02f7f6cc191" activityNameId="13e2dc43-2b09-56a4-805a-bd14a87d0611" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 800kW, fixed parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 800kW, fixed parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 40 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be about 1.4 GWh. Data are from a Nordex N50/800 plant. The foundation (concrete and reinforcing steel) is assumed to be remaining in the ground after the demolition of the power plant.;
UUID: 3942451a-46b5-391b-aca1-04cf98b3a9b2
Includes materials used for fixed parts: tower and base, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the transports needed, and the area that is needed for installation and the energy requirements for the installation itself.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average European technology for a 800 kW wind power plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3942451a-46b5-391b-aca1-04cf98b3a9b2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
